Description: Open‑source cross‑platform adversary emulation framework
 Sliver is a modern C2 framework by BishopFox for red‑team operations.
 It supports mTLS, WireGuard, HTTP(S) and DNS C2, with dynamically
 compiled implants and per‑binary encryption keys.
